OL,3,GNEWSATown's landmark tower blocks to be
OL,4,Ademolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town's landmark tower blocks, which
OL,7,Fhave dominated its skyline since the
OL,8,F1960s, are set to be demolished after
OL,9,Fyears of uncertainty over their future.
OL,11,FRochdale's Seven Sisters tower blocks,
OL,12,Fwhich contain 766 flats, will be
OL,13,Freplaced by about 600 homes, social
OL,14,Flandlord Rochdale Boroughwide Housing
OL,15,F(RBH) said.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
