OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATown's landmark tower blocks to be
OL,4,Ademolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents began moving out of the flats
OL,7,Fin October 2025 following concerns
OL,8,Fabout their long-term safety but a
OL,9,Flocal campaign, previously backed by
OL,10,FRochdale Council, had appealed for the
OL,11,Fbuildings to be refurbished rather than
OL,12,Fdemolished.
OL,14,FBut RBH said replacing the buildings
OL,15,Fwas the "only realistic and affordable
OL,16,Fway" to provide suitable homes for
OL,17,Fresidents.
